{"resourceIdentifier":"4089","resourceName":"Uirapuru Grouped REDD Project","description":"The Rio Branco Grouped REDD Project is located in the state of Acre, Brazil, initially formed by 2 properties composed of 100% of the Amazon Forest. The project aims to avoid unplanned deforestation (AUD) in an area of 8,318 ha and to avoid planned deforestation (APD) in an area of 464 ha. \r\n\r\nIn addition to the ecological and carbon benefits of the project, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving socio-environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control and developing environmental education and other social activities.","location":{"latitude":-9.940182,"longitude":-68.573132},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-30","endExclusive":"2023-03-02","endInclusive":"2023-03-01"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4089"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Acre"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Carbon Holding S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"17021"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0007,VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3290 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 13/10/2020 - 12/10/2050"}]}]}],"documentGroups":